title: Elephant_long
---
=> Yes I did hand make this costume. It took me approximately 164 hours to put it together, an actual ton of fabric, and some common sense. I think it's the best here, don't you?
=> This event is nice, I'm glad I came. There's too many people though, and I was wondering why you decided to arrange the stalls like that? Don't you think it would be better if it was the other way around?
=> That's not how you're supposed to carry those swords. They're supposed to be on the other side.
===